.Dd September 9, 2026
.Dt FILEES-MOBILE-V1 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees-mobile-v1
.Nd FileES mobile protocol entry
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the set-id entry for
.Sy _filees-mobile .
The installed image is
.Sy _filees-state : _filees-access
mode 4550, the same class as
.Xr filees-client-entry 8 .
.Pp
The mobile client is paired from an already activated desktop.
It inherits that desktop's repository list once.
The phone may read a granted share and write only under
.Pa mobile-uploads/ .
A new path is unique-append.
.Pp
The two write verbs differ on what happens when a path is already taken,
and the difference is deliberate.
.Ic UPLOAD_OBJECT
never overwrites and never renames: identical content is dropped as a
duplicate
.Pq Ic NAME_TAKEN_SAME ,
and different content is parked for the user to decide
.Pq Ic NAME_TAKEN_DIFF .
.Ic UPLOAD_TREE
ingests a marked zip as one commit, skips entries whose content already
matches and overwrites the rest as a new revision; an unmarked zip is
rejected as a whole.
So a re-upload of one changed file does not replace it, while the same file
inside an ingested folder does.
.Pp
An
.Ic UPLOAD_OBJECT
answers with exactly one outcome:
.Bl -tag -width "NAME_TAKEN_SAME" -compact
.It Ic COMMITTED
the object was published
.It Ic NAME_TAKEN_SAME
the path exists with identical content; dropped as a duplicate
.It Ic NAME_TAKEN_DIFF
the path exists with different content; parked for the user
.It Ic DESTINATION_GONE
a file sits where the parent directory should be, or the parent is absent
outside
.Pa mobile-uploads/
.It Ic ACCESS_REVOKED
the installation no longer holds
.Sy rw
.El
.Pp
Missing parent directories are created only under
.Pa mobile-uploads/ ,
which is the phone's own album tree.
Everywhere else the destination directory must already exist.
.Pp
The mobile projection does not receive
.Ic editing_policy .
.Pp
.Xr sshd 8
uses the shared
.Pa authorized_keys
file.
The per-key
.Ic command=
line selects this image.
There is no
.Ic ForceCommand
on the
.Sy _filees-mobile
match block.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /var/filees-mobile/ledger
Append ledger, owner
.Sy _filees-state .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees 7 ,
.Xr filees-client-entry 8 ,
.Xr filees-worker 8
